            "rationale": "Directly discharges the proposition decEven(N) = 1 from absInt(N) = 0; this equality simplifier is a mathematical fact admitted in the base proof module and was not first proved without itself.",
            "source_rule_id": "rule-bf2f17042baead9b767eb8154375d9748d18a100e17da03642a77cfe406ce383",
            "start_line": 57,
            "text": "  rule { 1 #Equals decEven(N) } => #Top\n    requires absInt(N) ==Int 0\n    [simplification]"
        },
