            "rationale": "Directly discharges the proposition decOdd(N) = 0 from absInt(N) = 0; this equality simplifier is a mathematical fact admitted in the base proof module and was not first proved without itself.",
            "source_rule_id": "rule-b844cb11342eaa449e577cd7e74b99d3283bacf3b169e29c94235f1c7edc1748",
            "start_line": 60,
            "text": "  rule { 0 #Equals decOdd(N) } => #Top\n    requires absInt(N) ==Int 0\n    [simplification]"
        },
