            "rationale": "Asserts the positive-magnitude sign-normalization equality evenPos(absInt(N)) = decEven(N); it rewrites an equality proposition to truth and has no prior exact proof in a module omitting it.",
            "source_rule_id": "rule-2f7142f79fcc9e619c4580decceb38a73bb3716819a71c7503d94cb1dc77b79c",
            "start_line": 63,
            "text": "  rule { evenPos(absInt(N)) #Equals decEven(N) } => #Top\n    requires absInt(N) >Int 0\n    [simplification]"
        },
